bin/
obj/
*.user

# Generated index. INDEX.md and FEATURES.md are committed, because their
# diffs show behaviour changing and they are derived purely from file
# contents — rebuild after an unrelated commit and nothing moves.
#
# The rest is not committed, and the test is the same one every time: does
# the artefact change when nothing about the source did? map.json is a 350 KB
# graph that regenerates in a second. HOTSPOTS.md ranks files by commit churn,
# so every commit changes it by construction — committing it meant the file
# was wrong the instant it landed, and the rebuild that fixed it was another
# commit that made it wrong again. The session hook builds both.
.claude/codemap/map.json
.claude/codemap/.stamp
.claude/codemap/HOTSPOTS.md

# Workflow agents get their own git worktrees under here.
.claude/worktrees/
